  "body": "Positioned directly opposite Seagate Reserve, this beautifully maintained full-brick home offers the kind of setting families look for: plenty of space, sunshine, privacy and an easy connection to the outdoors.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 550sqm section with approximately 187sqm of floor area, the home offers four bedrooms, two bathrooms and two living areas, providing plenty of room for growing families, guests or working from home.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this home stand out:\r\n\r\n• Full brick and tile construction, solid, timeless and built to last\r\n\r\n• Prime position opposite Seagate Reserve, enjoy a lovely green outlook right across the road\r\n\r\n• Four bedrooms, two bathrooms and two living areas, giving the family plenty of space and flexibility\r\n\r\n• Huge outdoor deck with plenty of room for dining, BBQs and entertaining\r\n\r\n• Covered patio area on the deck, providing shelter and a great spot to enjoy the afternoon sun\r\n\r\n• Swim spa pool is perfect for relaxing, entertaining or keeping the kids happy over summer\r\n\r\n• Excellent indoor-outdoor flow, with the living and dining areas connecting naturally to the outdoor spaces\r\n\r\nThe location is hard to beat. With Seagate Reserve right across the road and KingsWay School within walking distance, green space, recreation and schooling are all close at hand. Local parks, playgrounds, shops and cafes are also within easy reach, while Silverdale and motorway access are just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nIf you have been looking for a genuine family home with solid construction, generous land, fantastic outdoor living and a reserve outlook, this one deserves a closer look.\r\n\r\nCome along to the open home or get in touch today to arrange a private viewing.",
